| description = In the High Elf City of South Felwithe can be found the Keepers of the Art.  Three seperate guildhalls connected by magic teleporters are set peacfully around a small lake.  Kinool Goldsinger leads the [[Enchanter]]s, Niola Impholder the [[Magician]]s, and Tarker Blazetoss the [[Wizard]]s.  The Keepers support the Elven [[King Tearis Thex]] and the Kelethin Rangers guild called [[Faydarks Champions]].  They are opposed to the Dark Elf necromancers and shadowknights of [[The Dead]] faction in [[Neriak]].

